{"title": "The Sovereign's Key", "pageid": 22488, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/The_Sovereign's_Key", "categories": ["Misc items", "Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:The_Sovereigns_Key.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/The_Sovereigns_Key.png/300px-The_Sovereigns_Key.png.webp, /w/images/8/83/The_Sovereigns_Key.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"The Sovereign's Key image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/The_Sovereigns_Key.png/300px-The_Sovereigns_Key.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/The_Sovereigns_Key.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">The Sovereign's Key</span></a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous#Story_Items\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Story Item</a> which can be looted from <a href=\"/wiki/Spaw\" title=\"Spaw\">Sovereign Spaw's</a> body. While in the inventory of an active party member, it temporarily neutralizes all <a href=\"/wiki/Mushroom\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mushroom\">mushroom</a> and spore traps for the party in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This key was found on the Myconid Sovereign. It looks polished, well cared for, and very important.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Story Item\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Story Item</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.01 kg (0.02 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.01 kg (0.02 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Applies <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sovereign%27s_Protection_(Condition)\" title=\"Sovereign's Protection (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sovereign's Protection\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sovereign%27s_Protection_(Condition)\" title=\"Sovereign's Protection (Condition)\">Sovereign's Protection</a> to the entire party.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span id=\"Condition:_Sovereign.27s_Protection\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Sovereign's_Protection\"> Condition: Sovereign's Protection </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sovereign%27s_Protection_(Condition)\" title=\"Sovereign's Protection (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sovereign's Protection\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sovereign%27s_Protection_(Condition)\" title=\"Sovereign's Protection (Condition)\">Sovereign's Protection</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Protected from the myconids' mushroom traps by the Sovereign's spore sac.</li>\n<li>Mushroom traps like <a href=\"/wiki/Bibberbang\" title=\"Bibberbang\">Bibberbang</a> are temporarily disabled for the affected creature, enabling safe passage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spaw\" title=\"Spaw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Spaw.png/25px-Portrait_Spaw.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Spaw.png/38px-Portrait_Spaw.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Spaw.png/50px-Portrait_Spaw.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sovereign Spaw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Spaw.png/25px-Portrait_Spaw.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Portrait_Spaw.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spaw\" title=\"Spaw\">Sovereign Spaw</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item can be looted from Spaw if it is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Knocked Out\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\">Knocked Out</a>.</li>\n<li>If the party accept the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Avenge_Glut%27s_Circle\" title=\"Avenge Glut's Circle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Avenge Glut's Circle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Avenge_Glut%27s_Circle\" title=\"Avenge Glut's Circle\">Avenge Glut's Circle</a> and then refuse to kill Spaw, the effect of this item will be removed from the character who speaks with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glut\" title=\"Glut\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/25px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/38px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/50px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sovereign Glut\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/25px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glut\" title=\"Glut\">Sovereign Glut</a>; one can instead use a mercenary or companion not regularly kept in the party during this conversation, allowing regular party members to retain the effect.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"Needs verification.\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201120\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.059 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2607/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29140/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9748/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931763/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   51.415      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   51.415      1 -total\n 30.85%   15.861     10 Template:Icon_text\n 24.28%   12.482      7 Template:Icon_link\n 23.42%   12.043     23 Template:Trim\n 12.10%    6.219      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.61%    5.968      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.52%    5.924      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.27%    5.794      1 Template:Cond\n 10.37%    5.330      1 Template:SmCond\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:22488-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201120 and revision id 374529. Rendering